stemWords — Reduce words to their stems so different forms of the same word group together.
  needs: text: string
  e.g. "stem running runs and runner" → {"text":"running runs runner"}

tokenizeSentences — Break a passage at its full stops into separate sentences.
  needs: text: string
  e.g. "split this into sentences" → {"text":"Hello there. How are you? I am well."}

